## 1. Donation State Machine

```
                    ┌──────────┐
                    │ INITIATED│ ← Order created via /api/create-order
                    └────┬─────┘
                         │
                    User opens Razorpay Checkout
                         │
              ┌──────────┴──────────┐
              │                     │
         User Pays            User Cancels
              │                     │
              ▼                     ▼
        ┌──────────┐         ┌──────────┐
        │ PENDING  │         │ CANCELLED│ (terminal)
        └────┬─────┘         └──────────┘
             │
     Webhook received
             │
    ┌────────┴────────┐
    │                 │
 payment.captured  payment.failed
    │                 │
    ▼                 ▼
┌───────────┐   ┌──────────┐
│ COMPLETED │   │  FAILED  │ (terminal)
└─────┬─────┘   └──────────┘
      │
  Manual action (Razorpay Dashboard)
      │
      ▼
┌───────────┐
│ REFUNDED  │ (terminal)
└───────────┘
```

---

## 2. State Transition Rules

| From | To | Trigger | Action |
|---|---|---|---|
| — | `initiated` | `/api/create-order` succeeds | Create donation record |
| `initiated` | `pending` | `/api/verify-payment` succeeds | Update status, store payment IDs |
| `initiated` | `cancelled` | User closes Razorpay Checkout | No DB update (client-side only) |
| `pending` | `completed` | Webhook: `payment.captured` | Update status, update `raised_amount` on cause |
| `pending` | `failed` | Webhook: `payment.failed` | Update status |
| `completed` | `refunded` | Manual refund via Razorpay Dashboard | Update status (webhook or manual) |

### Invalid Transitions (Must Reject)
- `completed` → `initiated` ❌
- `failed` → `completed` ❌
- `refunded` → `completed` ❌
- `cancelled` → `pending` ❌

