## 3. Error Scenarios & Handling

### 3.1 Client-Side Errors

| Error | Cause | User Sees | Action |
|---|---|---|---|
| Form validation failed | Empty name, invalid email | Inline error messages | Prevent form submission |
| Amount out of range | < ₹1 or > ₹100,000 | "Please enter amount between ₹1 and ₹1,00,000" | Prevent submission |
| Razorpay Checkout failed to load | Script blocked, network error | "Payment service unavailable. Please try again." | Retry button |
| User cancelled Razorpay Checkout | User clicked X or back | Return to donation form, no error shown | No action needed |
| Network error during verify-payment | Internet dropped after payment | "Payment is being verified. Please don't close this page." | Auto-retry 3 times, then show support contact |

### 3.2 Server-Side Errors

| Error | Cause | HTTP Code | Response | Recovery |
|---|---|---|---|---|
| Invalid amount | Negative or zero amount | 400 | `{ error: "Invalid donation amount" }` | Client shows validation error |
| Razorpay order creation failed | Razorpay API down | 502 | `{ error: "Payment service unavailable" }` | Client shows retry message |
| Invalid payment signature | Tampered data or wrong keys | 400 | `{ error: "Payment verification failed" }` | Log alert, don't save donation |
| Invalid webhook signature | Not from Razorpay | 401 | Empty 401 response | Log + ignore |
| Database insert failed | Supabase down | 500 | `{ error: "Unable to process donation" }` | Log error, manual reconciliation |
| Duplicate order ID | Re-submission | 409 | `{ error: "Donation already processed" }` | Return existing donation |
| Admin unauthorized | Invalid/expired session | 401 | `{ error: "Unauthorized" }` | Redirect to login |

### 3.3 Webhook Errors

| Error | Cause | Action |
|---|---|---|
| Webhook signature invalid | Tampered or wrong secret | Return 401, log alert |
| Donation not found for order_id | Race condition, DB delay | Return 200 (Razorpay will retry), log warning |
| Duplicate webhook event | Razorpay retry | Idempotent handling — check if already processed, return 200 |
| Database update failed | Supabase down | Return 500 (Razorpay will retry), log critical |

---

## 4. Retry Strategy

| Operation | Max Retries | Backoff | Timeout |
|---|---|---|---|
| Create Razorpay Order | 2 | 1s, 2s | 10s |
| Verify Payment (client → server) | 3 | 1s, 2s, 4s | 15s |
| Supabase Insert | 2 | 500ms, 1s | 5s |
| Webhook Processing | Handled by Razorpay | Razorpay retries for 24h | — |

---

## 5. User-Facing Error Messages

### Tone: Reassuring, clear, actionable

| Scenario | Message |
|---|---|
| Payment failed | "Your payment could not be processed. No amount has been deducted. Please try again." |
| Network error during payment | "We're verifying your payment. Please don't close this page. If the issue persists, contact us." |
| Service unavailable | "Our payment service is temporarily unavailable. Please try again in a few minutes." |
| Invalid amount | "Please enter a valid donation amount between ₹1 and ₹1,00,000." |
| Session expired (admin) | "Your session has expired. Please log in again." |
| Generic server error | "Something went wrong. Please try again. If the problem continues, contact support." |

---

## 6. Error Logging

### What to Log
| Event | Log Level | Data to Capture |
|---|---|---|
| Order creation failed | ERROR | amount, Razorpay error response |
| Payment verification failed | ERROR | order_id, payment_id, signature mismatch details |
| Webhook signature invalid | WARN | IP address, headers, payload hash |
| Database operation failed | ERROR | operation, table, error message |
| Successful donation | INFO | donation_id, amount, status |
| Admin login | INFO | admin email, timestamp |
| Admin login failed | WARN | attempted email, IP address |

### Where to Log
- Development: `console.log` / `console.error`
- Production: Vercel Logs (built-in) or external service (future)

---

## 7. Graceful Degradation

| Component Failed | Fallback Behavior |
|---|---|
| Supabase down (read) | Show cached cause data or static fallback |
| Supabase down (write) | Queue donation in memory, retry, show "processing" message |
| Razorpay API down | Disable "Donate Now" button, show "temporarily unavailable" |
| Razorpay Checkout JS failed to load | Show manual bank transfer instructions as fallback |
| Admin API failed | Show "Unable to load data" with retry button |
